---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Mentor Network (AMN-SK)">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-900 to-slate-900 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-300">About the Organization</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-2 text-white">About the Mentor Network (AMN-SK)</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-sky-100/90 mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Building resilient, collaborative healthcare leadership and clinical support across Saskatchewan through intentional, peer-driven mentorship.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Our Purpose & Vision</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base mb-4">
          The Mentor Network was established to address the unique professional and personal challenges faced by healthcare practitioners throughout Saskatchewan. From early-career medical transitions to navigating rural clinical isolation, peer mentorship is one of the most effective catalysts for retention, professional wellbeing, and clinical confidence.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
          By connecting experienced clinical mentors with enthusiastic mentees, we cultivate a culture of lifelong learning, mutual respect, and collaborative problem-solving that directly strengthens patient care in our province.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-sky-800 mb-2">For Health Providers</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Evidence-based tools, orientation checklists, and interprofessional frameworks designed to smooth transition into practice and prevent burnout.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-teal-800 mb-2">For Patients & Families</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Accessible, plain-language resources demystifying healthcare navigation, care team collaboration, and proactive wellness planning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">Financial Support & Governance</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
          The Mentor Network operates through dedicated provincial grants, clinical education partnerships, and voluntary clinical leadership contributions. All funds are directed toward peer training frameworks, resource curation, and maintaining secure, private infrastructure for participants.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
          <a href="/about/people" class="text-sm font-bold text-sky-700 hover:underline">Meet our Leadership & Team →</a>
          <a href="/apply" class="text-sm font-bold text-teal-700 hover:underline">Apply to Join the Network →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
